==External Applications==
*'''Miqra according to the Masorah''' serves as the text of the Tanakh within '''[http://mg.alhatorah.org/ Mikra'ot Gedolot Al Hatorah]'''.
*'''Miqra according to the Masorah''' has been available at '''[https://www.sefaria.org.il/Genesis.1?vhe=Miqra_according_to_the_Masorah&lang=bi&aliyot=0 Sefaria]''' since 4 Shevat 5781 (17.01.2021), and became the default Hebrew version of the Tanakh on 9 Sivan 5781 (20.05.2021).
*A module for '''Miqra according to the Masorah''' was developed for '''[https://www.accordancebible.com/ Accordance Bible Software]''' (the text remains open content).
Work on all of these applications contributed to the correction of numerous small errors and helped improve the accuracy of the text.

